Output docs/assets/memory-demo.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 960
Set Height 760
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0
Set Framerate 15
Set WaitTimeout 60s
Set Shell "zsh"

Type "cd docs/assets"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "bun memory-demo.ts"
Enter
Wait+Screen /DONE/
Sleep 800ms
